---
description: SimpleUI coding-agent workflow and security rules
globs: ["**/*.sui", "docs/**/*.md", "*.go", "internal/**/*.go", "components/**/*.go"]
alwaysApply: false
---

Read [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md) before changing SUI or compiler code. Use
[`docs/manifest.json`](../../docs/manifest.json) and
[`docs/AGENT_RECIPES.md`](../../docs/AGENT_RECIPES.md) to choose the canonical
pattern. After editing a `.sui` file run `simpleui check app.sui --json`.
Commit every tracked change before finishing (`git add -A && git commit`); do
not leave the working tree dirty. Do not bypass `cssSafe`, `*Safe` URL
allow-lists, iframe `srcAllow`/sandbox defaults, table `textContent`, or desktop
capability checks.
